<div class="WordSection1">
<p>Dear Sir/Madam, <o:p></o:p></p>
<p>I would like to apprise you that Said Shipment expected to arrive under DELHI cargo-mode. We respect your decision to appoint your own broker for clearance of this shipment .
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p><b><span style="font-size:14.0pt;color:red">Please find the attached AWB/ CI in &#8220;.tiff&#8221; format for filling the documents.(Open with Window Photo Viewer)<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
<p>The shipment is expected to arrive, MAWB and IGM will be provided once generated.
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p>You may file BOE in prior without MAWB to avoid late penalty. <o:p></o:p></p>
<p>Further if you need FedEx Authorized Broker (JEENA/SUNIMPEX) to clear the shipment, Please write to
<a href="mailto:darain.saad@fedex.com">darain.saad@fedex.com</a>; <a href="mailto:jane.alam@fedex.com">
jane.alam@fedex.com</a>; <a href="mailto:ayush.saklani@fedex.com">ayush.saklani@fedex.com</a>;
<a href="mailto:neha.sambhyal@fedex.com">neha.sambhyal@fedex.com</a>; <a href="mailto:priyansh.sinha@fedex.com">
